data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":2542,"response":{"id":"resp_0aa41dd63d0397f1016adb47e84c3881919b7cd4992c88b534","object":"response","created_at":1792755688,"completed_at":1792755710,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through structured submit_draft (preferred) or the compatible submit_artifact wrapper. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0aa41dd63d0397f1016adb47ec5574819182f460b6f8f6e05c","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq20fswPUpacwXVUoH6QknR8hhzIGWowvR7VrliRGKdZsIfPHsEJY9ykY7YLU8lyKKs9qCcGH_xc3pkep7TDCas0lxzWDbD66jp-IjU27vytjjYhJoNsXQynBAMuaiFQr90MpkAG51PrOhxgVhYNIEod7r2N60nVeevf-NMB_7NOT-vXcUzBqZFXWw6Jwumz3_luaOd8PGTFZXlH8TRmn2Aoz4JHuh-4CQDX5wcJv86-kWWjBu73Eu3qt8GEyjqATXmy99IVQAbyxiX5r9GiqH4YPYhjYeKlsViTVSemCx4lsFxkB-rUwQLqa4ke6g8g_9yB9ezlgtrqJv39NNH7ihVLGVGUuOQOv-1mHZ8OZNqHlDXxaGKdc1_3-aYCBqKko_22j7y2Ee7xyhNa5uyIig6WgePkW7zbt5-u-_g7Dz2FMFAPpv5syqS_cFn3riJ7gy4Cp9H5IPsFaobNrJKpY8n0hqWxD5Lj36Id36A_W1aSGtZ6YTKURRLWo1LwGRVsSVqtoqtw21z2PPW9LvDqVhxtJVpCh1O21fHSpyxsoIi72TtbUvAeJAdjgq_l7OmaBrx2EE1_l-ydWgNuE6NjsvuKTBCtOwAs3SwnjO-msdcVvYGR95CTSkbr9-_ro017GoZyHI5plP-kvGqScGECZMm7iF9l8nCLeIaAOPWVuis-OL-FRiNf-taYOGsEjMPL8kPWoWaWef_KmbYF88UiVHZ5Rh-7XqKa33l45QCHt5B_OzbvwyKVeC2a3lzqPXPaAeLqO192cbVI-nYBUAVTH_1Ljejj74TJAN7idRgpFspF-QYu1A3Dbcpqa45l2cW5eH5xgWJFbph8Ea7jf_tMOIVSQobzfHMuP24ijPUJNOKVKl-iIc1EoYHQ8TLLVTw80DOQzguYtiLU1hqXHjgErW8B35pkGiEJxZoj_PztLsMevotcCsnT5osKVPs5Alr12EwHV4oCC9YQlBqO7CKmRLc5Dxr7Dfu